TurboFieldfare is a specialized inference runtime for Apple Silicon that enables running large language models on hardware with severely constrained RAM. The project’s central innovation is its ability to execute the Gemma 4 26B-A4B model using only ~2 GB of resident memory, bypassing the need to load the full 14.3 GB parameter set into RAM simultaneously.

**Resource Constraints and Data Partitioning**
